19466       * Source: S154 / Chapter 118 / `Totals` (PDF pp. 9642–9643); S154 / Chapter 118 / `Covariances of Frequency Estimates` (PDF pp. 9643–9644); S154
19466    !  / Chapter 118 / `Confidence Limits for Totals` (PDF pp. 9646–9647).
19467       * Discriminates: Verified default procedure context
19468       */
19469      options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
19469    ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
19470      %let syscc=0;
19471      title; footnote;
19472      ods _all_ close;
19473      ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
19474      ods graphics off;
19475      proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
NOTE: File WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SURVEY (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.TEMPLAT (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
19475    !                                         quit;


19476      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
19477      
19478      data survey;
19479      do state=1 to 2;
19480      do school=1 to 4;
19481      do id=1 to 6;
19482      response=1+mod(id+school,3);
19483      schooltype=1+mod(school,2);
19484      samplingweight=2+state+school/10;
19485      output;
19486      end;
19487      end;
19488      end;
19489      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 48 observations and 6 variables.

19490      proc surveyfreq data=survey;
19491      strata state;
19492      cluster school;
19493      weight samplingweight;
19494      tables schooltype*response / row chisq;
19495      run;

NOTE: The Rao-Scott chi-square test cannot be computed for the table of schooltype by response because the design correction is not positive.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYFREQ printed page 1387.

